.TH INSTALL\-CONTROLROOM 1 "2026-06-12" "Mu2e DAQ" "Mu2e DAQ Manual"
.SH NAME
install\-controlroom.sh \- install the control room bin area on a DAQ host
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B install\-controlroom.sh
.SH DESCRIPTION
Runs
.B on
a DAQ host as the session-owner account, normally invoked by
.B crs\-remote install
which ships this script together with the rest of the payload as a tar
stream over ssh.
.PP
The installer:
.IP 1. 4
creates
.BR ~/controlroom/{bin,etc,log} " and " ~/.crs ;
.IP 2. 4
installs the session scripts
.RB ( start/stop/status\-vnc\-session.sh ),
the discovery responder sidecar, the
.B crs\-app
port-assignment wrapper, and
.B crs\-provision\-desktop
into
.BR ~/controlroom/bin ;
.IP 3. 4
installs
.BR controlroom.yaml ", " apps.yaml ", and " xstartup
into
.BR ~/controlroom/etc ;
.IP 4. 4
appends a marker-guarded, idempotent PATH stanza to
.B ~/.bash_profile
.RB ( ">>> mu2edaq\-controlroom >>>" );
.IP 5. 4
symlinks each application's standardized
.BR start\-*.sh / stop\-*.sh
from its checkout
.RB ( install_path
in apps.yaml) into the bin area, when present on the host.
.PP
Safe to re-run; existing installs are refreshed in place.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B CRS_HOME
Override the install area (default ~/controlroom).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR crs\-remote (1),
.BR crs\-app (1),
.BR start\-vnc\-session (1)
